      <div type="clause" n="9.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 9.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Geo wæs goldðeofe ⁊ stódðeofe ⁊ beoðeofe, ⁊ manig witu maran ðonne oþru; nu sint eal gelic buton manðeofe: CXX scill.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Earlier the fines for a gold-thief and a stud-thief and a bee-thief and many fines were greater than others; now all are alike except theft of a person:120 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">Formerly the fines to be paid by those who stole gold and horses and bees, and many other fines, were greater than the rest. Now all fines, with the exception of that for stealing men—120 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Geo wæs goldðeofe ⁊ stodðeofe ⁊ beoþeofe, ⁊ monegu witu maran ðonne oþru; nu sint eall gelic buton monþeofe: CXX scll'.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
